  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, $I=20 \\sin (100 \\pi t+0.05 \\pi)$\r\nThe root mean square value of alternating\r\n$$\r\n\\text { current }=l_{\\mathrm{ms}}=\\frac{l_{0}}{\\sqrt{2}}=\\frac{20}{\\sqrt{2}}=10 \\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{A}\r\n$$\r\nAlso, $\\quad \\omega=100 \\pi$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad 2 \\pi f=100 \\pi$ or $f=50 \\mathrm{Hz}$",
